## ≡뿯ƽ뿯½뿯▽ Disaster Recovery Plan (DRP)਍ഀ
਍ഀ
| Risiko | Dampak | Mitigasi |਍ഀ
|---------|---------|-----------|਍ഀ
| **Server crash / OS corrupt** | Layanan berhenti | Snapshot harian (Oracle & Node), auto-restore |਍ഀ
| **Kegagalan koneksi Oracle** | API timeout | Pool fallback 뿯ν뿯½뿯½ alias cadangan |਍ഀ
| **Kehilangan log** | Audit tidak utuh | Backup `logs/` mingguan ke NAS lokal |਍ഀ
| **Error build Next.js** | Front-end tidak aktif | Rollback otomatis build `.next/prev` |਍ഀ
| **Session rusak** | Logout massal | Middleware fallback 뿯ν뿯½뿯½ redirect login |਍ഀ
| **Load tinggi** | API delay | Auto-scale ringan (PM2 cluster / Docker) |਍ഀ
਍ഀ
**Backup Policy:**਍ഀ
- **DB Oracle:** export dump harian (level schema) + retention 7 hari.  ਍ഀ
- **Aplikasi:** backup `.next`, `logs`, `.env`, dan `data/menu`.  ਍ഀ
- **Recovery Test:** dilakukan minimal 1x per kuartal.  ਍ഀ
਍ഀ
